Thai Waters Rev F | speaker_cue
* Differential 1.40 V peak sine at 1 kHz into 6.0 ohms.
* Model: Voltage envelope applied differentially to J9. A resistive load bounds the nominal sine heating; excludes PA gain, clipping, PWM, resonance and acoustic SPL.
Vcm cm 0 2.1
Vone plus cm SIN(0 0.7 1000)
Vtwo cm minus SIN(0 0.7 1000)
Rcoil plus minus 6
Ediff diff 0 plus minus 1
.TRAN 5u 4m 0 5u
.PRINT TRAN V(diff)
.END
